WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.467
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.968
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.767
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.400
President Biden
and Chinese President Xi Jinping

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.467
are reportedly
prepared to announce

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:13.467
the return of
the direct military hotline,

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.667
and -- this is fun -- they're
letting Biden pick the phone.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:19.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.100
The third Republican
presidential debate

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.434
was held last night in Miami.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.734
What's the point?

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.701
It's like going to a NSYNC
concert without Justin.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.334
We don't know the rest of you.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.400
During the first few minutes
of last night's debate,

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.667
moderator Lester Holt

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.467
admonished the crowd
several times

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.601
for cheering and applauding,

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.868
saying, "Let's not do this."

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:42.701
Man, you know, our political
decorum is in bad shape

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:44.367
when the moderator has to talk
to the audience

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.934
like they're his ex-wife.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:48.968
"Can we not do this today,
Bethany?

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:52.801
I'm just here
to drop off the kids."

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:54.267
During last night's debate,

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:55.868
Vivek Ramaswamy criticized

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.801
Nikki Haley's
foreign policy views

00:00:57.801 --> 00:01:01.067
and said she was "Dick Cheney
in three-inch heels."

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.667
"Hey, I'm right here,"
said Ron DeSantis.

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:06.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.133
After Vivek Ramaswamy criticized
Nikki Haley's daughter

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.067
for using TikTok
during last night's debate,

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.834
Haley told Ramaswamy to

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.901
"keep my daughter's name
out of your voice."

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.167
And even though he was
thousands of miles away,

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:18.968
Chris Rock instinctively ducked.

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:25.100
During last night's debate,
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.601
said that voters
shouldn't support

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:29.000
former President Trump in 2024,

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.367
and added that he's a "different
guy than he was in 2016."

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.367
Of course, thanks to Trump
we're all different guys

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.801
than we were in 2016.

00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:39.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:42.400
Politico published an article
today after last night's debate

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.033
titled "Tim Scott's Girlfriend
Is, in Fact, Real."

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.801
However, jury's still out
on Tim Scott.

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.567
According to a new report,
the quality of the

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:54.300
in-flight food onboard
Air Force Two has improved.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.667
Oh, you mean
since Mike Pence used it?

00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:01.100
The guy who thinks
oregano is a sin?

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.667
He threw away the beverage cart

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:06.033
when that Sprite
gave him a hangover.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:08.300
The FBI and Italian authorities
announced yesterday

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.334
they arrested 17 men
allegedly connected

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:11.767
with the Gambino crime family

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.467
on charges including Mafia
association and arson.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.534
Though, officials say
it could still be weeks

00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:19.300
before Netflix is able to
release a show about it.

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:25.167
A bear in Florida recently stole
a $45 Taco Bell order

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:27.467
from the front porch of a home.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:28.334
Wait a minute.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:29.334
How...

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:33.000
do you spend $45 at Taco Bell?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.167
What did you order? All of it?

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:36.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:39.000
And finally, the FDA
has launched an investigation

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.467
into counterfeit versions
of the weight-loss drug Ozempic.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:45.834
Users first became suspicious
when they noticed Wilma.

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:49.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.901 --> 00:02:54.033
That was a monologue, everybody!
We're off.

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:55.467
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

